OL,3,AUS strikes Iranian island ahead of
OL,4,Amidterm elections
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US has launched strikes on Iran's
OL,7,FQeshm Island in the Strait of Hormuz,
OL,8,FUS officials have told CBS, the BBC's
OL,9,FUS partner.
OL,11,FIranian state news agency Irna reported
OL,12,Fseveral explosions on the island on
OL,13,FMonday.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
