OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AUS strikes Iranian island ahead of
OL,4,Amidterm elections
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US officials described the strikes
OL,7,Fas limited and said they were in
OL,8,Fresponse to Iran's Islamic
OL,9,FRevolutionary Guard Corps (IRGC) firing
OL,10,Fupon a US aircraft. The BBC has
OL,11,Fcontacted US Central Command (Centcom),
OL,12,Fthe part of the US military responsible
OL,13,Ffor operations in the Middle East, for
OL,14,Fcomment.
OL,16,FIt comes ahead of the US midterm
OL,17,Felections, which will determine whether
OL,18,Fthe Republicans or Democrats control
OL,19,FCongress.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
